      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "YOU FOUND ME (2) was responsible for a modest effort most recently when seventh at Traralgon over 350m behind Challenger (20.69) in a Grade 5. The form out of last race has been strong. Has claims if she runs up to expectations. ONE KNEE NONI (1) jumps from the inside draw. Latest effort finished 6th over 350m at this track beaten 5.5 lengths (19.76) behind Flaming Fox in a Special conditions Veteran race on September 20. Looks one of the chances. BARKING BLUE (8) had a tricky draw last time and although midfield in fifth wasn't far away finishing 3 lengths from the winner (19.81). Form here at the trip sound including six wins. Solid formlines coming through his last run. Cannot be taken lightly. SUAVE (5) is worth including.",
